          "guid": "mszs55vr9hfb0hlg",
          "message": {
            "text": "positionAnchored is the single source of truth for anchored placement — popover, autoReposition, and tooltip all route through it, so there's no second copy of the flip/clamp math to drift.\n\nKF-491 asked to export popover's positioning \"guts, minus mount/dismiss.\" Rather than duplicate the below/flip-above/horizontal-clamp logic into a standalone util, the reconcile inverted the dependency: positionAnchored (one-shot) holds the math, autoReposition wraps it with the scroll(capture)/resize listeners + a disposer, and popover now just calls autoReposition instead of carrying its own inline reposition(). tooltip composes the same autoReposition over an overlay(dismiss:false). The pre-existing popover unit tests (flip-above, horizontal-clamp, align:end, reposition-on-scroll, listener-cleanup) passed unchanged through the refactor, which is the evidence the extraction is behavior-preserving — the placement contract is identical, just relocated.\n",
            "markdown": "`positionAnchored` is the single source of truth for anchored placement — `popover`, `autoReposition`, and `tooltip` all route through it, so there's no second copy of the flip/clamp math to drift.\n\nKF-491 asked to export popover's positioning \"guts, minus mount/dismiss.\" Rather than duplicate the below/flip-above/horizontal-clamp logic into a standalone util, the reconcile inverted the dependency: `positionAnchored` (one-shot) holds the math, `autoReposition` wraps it with the scroll(capture)/resize listeners + a disposer, and `popover` now just calls `autoReposition` instead of carrying its own inline `reposition()`. `tooltip` composes the same `autoReposition` over an `overlay(dismiss:false)`. The pre-existing popover unit tests (flip-above, horizontal-clamp, align:end, reposition-on-scroll, listener-cleanup) passed unchanged through the refactor, which is the evidence the extraction is behavior-preserving — the placement contract is identical, just relocated.\n"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/overlay.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 570,
                  "endLine": 570,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  // Vertical: preferred side, flipped only if it overflows and the other side fits."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
